    {
      "id": "saga-sm-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 88,
      "width": 1720,
      "height": 20,
      "text": "Saga 状态机: START → Fork1(五路摄取) → Join1 → GoldenSignal → CascadeDetect → AnomalyScorer → [拓扑层输出 ROOT_SERVICE] → Fork2(AI 三路 MCP 按需查询) → Join2 → 5Whys → Postmortem → Cross-System → Fork3(多渠道分发) → CLOSED",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "strokeColor": "#862e9c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": null
    },
    {
      "id": "saga-notes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 113,
      "width": 1720,
      "height": 56,
      "text": "通信: Asynchronous (Kafka 解耦)  |  一致性: Eventual (诊断是只读汇聚)  |  协调: Orchestrated (Mediator 管理状态)\n并行点: Fork1(5路摄取向 Kafka 发送, 超时30s)  Fork2(AI 并发查询 ClickHouse/ES/PG 历史故障)  Fork3(Slack/Postmortem/AutoFix 异步分发)\n容错/降级: K8S_NO_DATA → confidence↓  |  CASCADE_FAIL → 简单 error-ratio TopN  |  ES_QUERY_FAIL → 仅用 CH+PG 数据  |  FIVE_WHYS_FAIL → 部分结论 + Escalation 升档  |  幂等: PG saga_events.correlation_id UNIQUE",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "strokeColor": "#862e9c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": null
    },
