    {
      "id": "saga-comp-tbody",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 75,
      "text": "Failure                 →  Saga Action\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nK8S_NO_DATA              →  confidence -20%, 标记缺失字段, 不阻塞\nCASCADE_DETECT_FAIL      →  降级为简单 error-ratio TopN 规则匹配\nES_QUERY_FAIL            →  跳过 ES, 仅用 ClickHouse + PG 历史\nFIVE_WHYS_ANALYSIS_FAIL  →  输出部分结论 (置信度标记) + Escalation\nPG_WRITE_FAIL            →  本地 WAL 缓冲, retry×3 → S3 backup",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": null
    },
